y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids January to February, August to September and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025, June to July landed at 65% of normal on the middle of the grids, while November to December came in at 146%. Grid 30968 had its driest year in 1974 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
